# 5103_kth.patch (bodies.kth_smallest_row's bisection) is retired: since lane cluster-cpu
# (2026-09-28) the host selects over the magnitude bits (5103_host_select.patch) and the device
# runs its radix select (5120_kth_radix.patch); the bisection is reached only for a k outside
# 1..n_cols, which kth_check does not plant, so that arm could not fail (m2pro, 2026-09-29)
